Hard-disable telemetry at build time (PATCH_OUT_TELEMETRY, default 1).

Forces shouldEnableMetrics to false so event.Init never runs and the PostHog
client (endpoint https://data.charm.land, internal/event/event.go) is never
constructed. Complements the CRUSH_DISABLE_METRICS/DO_NOT_TRACK env and the
crushrc metrics option with a build-level guarantee. The gate is proven total:
every emitter early-returns while the client is nil (see
tasks/reference/dependency-network-audit.md section 4.3).

